CORE
missed.c
--no-standard-checks
^\[main.assertion.1\] line \d+ assertion w.v.c != 2: FAILURE$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
--
Copying a union whose first widest member is _Bool must preserve the bytes.
A typecast to _Bool would turn the byte value 2 into 1, and the failing
assertion would be reported as passing.
